# Internal Claude guidance (paired with CLAUDE.local.md; keep local, never in the tarball).
# NOTE: scripts/deploy.sh tars the working tree and only --excludes CLAUDE.local.md, so
# ignoring this keeps it out of git but NOT out of the tarball - deploy.sh needs a matching
# --exclude='CLAUDE.md' to stop it shipping to the box.
